<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle lightly traded - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle lightly traded - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers not well tested.</p>
